### LOCAL ONLY: first activate a one-use development session on this same origin.
@origin = http://127.0.0.1:4180
@orderId = REPLACE_WITH_AUTHORIZED_ORDER_UUID
@areaId = REPLACE_WITH_AREA_UUID
@csrf = REPLACE_IN_LOCAL_TOOL_ONLY
@requestKey = REPLACE_WITH_NEW_16_TO_128_CHARACTER_KEY
@orderVersion = 1

### Read current evidence, source snapshot and blockers; no state change
GET {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/intake-check

### Register manual evidence using the actual current item IDs
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/intake-evidence
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}
If-Match: "{{orderVersion}}"

{
  "pickup": {"method":"PHONE","reference":"DEMO confirmation","entrance":"DEMO warehouse entrance"},
  "delivery": {"method":"MESSAGE","reference":"DEMO confirmation","entrance":"DEMO recipient entrance"},
  "measurements": [{"clientItemId":"box-1","source":"CUSTOMER_DECLARED","reference":"DEMO packed dimensions","packagingConfirmed":true}]
}

### Submit: new key per distinct command; exact same key/body/version only for retry
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/submit
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}
If-Match: "{{orderVersion}}"

{}

### Return requires current validating version; previous evidence will not carry forward
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/orders/{{orderId}}/actions/return-to-draft
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}
If-Match: "{{orderVersion}}"

{"reason":"DEMO address correction requires re-verification"}

### Coverage geometry is [longitude, latitude], closed single ring
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/service-areas
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}

{"name":"DEMO city test","type":"ALLOW","polygon":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[104.8,11.4],[105,11.4],[105,11.6],[104.8,11.6],[104.8,11.4]]]},"effectiveFrom":"2026-10-25T00:00:00Z"}

### Publish draft v1; not a real operational boundary
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/service-areas/{{areaId}}/actions/publish
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}
If-Match: "1"

{"reason":"DEMO controlled local test"}

### List all current projections, including retired regions
GET {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/service-areas?limit=50

### Retire active v2; allow coverage may now close
POST {{origin}}/api/ops/v1/service-areas/{{areaId}}/actions/retire
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: {{requestKey}}
If-Match: "2"

{"reason":"DEMO test completed"}
